        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn KS3JI, Timeless Stainless Steel Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe timelessness of this handleset comes from the combination of contemporary materials with old world construction. The Timeless Stainless Steel Mortise Enrtyset is forged by a blacksmith using the traditional techniques of the hammer and anvil so each piece is a unique work of art. The natural stainless steel finish has an uneven pattern similar to antique nickel or pewter. This mortise cylinder lockset with lever will look great with almost any decor. It is available in a single cylinder and dummy functions for 1-3/4\" thick doors with a 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Timeless Stainless Steel Mortise Enrtyset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Height: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a. 4-1/4” minimum.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Blank trim for non-working doors that does not have a turnpiece or a cylinder. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a lever from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the lever. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Due to the handmade craftsman nature of this product, all dimensions are approximate. DO NOT DRILL ANY HOLES until you have the actual pieces to be mounted.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Timeless Stainless Steel Mortise Enrtyset, Acorn KS3JI",
                "description": "Timeless Stainless Steel Mortise Lockset Acorn KS3JI - The timelessness of this handleset comes from the combination of contemporary materials with old world construction. The Timeless Stainless Steel Mortise Enrtyset is forged by a blacksmith using the traditional techniques of the hammer and anvil so each piece is a unique work of art. The natural stainless steel finish has an uneven pattern similar to antique nickel or pewter. This mortise cylinder lockset with lever will look great with almost any decor. It is available in a single cylinder and dummy functions for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with a 2-3/4 inch backset.",
